Package: torontocrimeexplorer
Title: Toronto Crime Explorer
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("STA 313 project team", role = "aut"),
    person("Kevin", "Yang", role = "cre"))
Description: An interactive explorer of historical Toronto crime records, with
    consistent spatial and temporal filters. Originally developed by a team of six
    students for STA 313 Data Visualization and modernized with AI assistance.
    See PROVENANCE.md for contribution details.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    shiny,
    bslib,
    leaflet,
    plotly,
    ggplot2,
    data.table
